'''Tidal Wave''' is an environmental [[debuff]] in the boss room of [[Tsoagoth, The Brine King]], as well as its map version [[Nassar, Lion of the Seas]]. Touching the boundaries of the circular arena, which are made of tidal waves, will apply this debuff.

The debuff deals cold [[damage over time]] as well as [[Action speed|slows]] the player character.

